      "options": ["Dollars", "Roubles", "She is not paid", "She does not say the currency"],
      "answer": 0 },
    { "ask": "How much does she earn?",
      "options": ["She will not say", "A great deal", "Very little", "The same as Oleg"], "answer": 0 },
